          "reference_appearance": "Cobalt rectangular chest, pale opaque faceted central mound with smaller surrounding crystals, warm brass corner caps, long clasp, separate round disk, side ring, and squat irregular gray feet.",
          "suggested_disposition": "candidate-with-limitations",
          "user_review_focus": "Whether the faithful stylized blue/crystal silhouette is sufficient despite weak cut-glass material expression and coarse finish.",
          "views": {
            "desktop_closed": "Cobalt body and icy faceted lid ornaments preserve the reference silhouette and brass hardware hierarchy. Thick dark lid seam; softly mottled broad panels; whole model and controls fit.",
            "desktop_open": "Blue underside and empty blue cavity are visible, with gray rim strips, two brass rear hinges and an upright lid clasp. Whole lid and feet remain in frame; Close lid label agrees with pose.",
            "mobile_closed": "Same recognizable crystal cluster and cobalt/brass palette. Fine hardware and feet are coarse at phone scale. Heading wraps with Glass alone on the second line; no truncation.",
            "mobile_open": "Open cavity, gray rim and projecting brass clasp remain legible and contained. Small edge stepping and abrupt rim corners are more conspicuous; controls remain separate from model."
          },
          "visible_concerns_not_proven_malfunctions": [
            "Heavy closed seam and coarse rim junctions warrant another-angle inspection, but do not demonstrate a detached lid.",
            "Small hardware and diagonal silhouettes have aliasing; capture resolution may contribute."
          ]
        }
